# The Gradle wrapper is STILL not checked in, and it should be as soon as
# anyone can generate it.
#
# It stays ignored only because it could not be produced: this machine's proxy
# does not reach services.gradle.org, so Gradle itself cannot be installed and
# `gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.14.3` cannot be run. The jar is a binary
# and inventing one is not an option. On a machine with normal network access,
# run that command once, delete these three lines, and commit the results —
# gradle-wrapper.properties already pins the version it should generate.
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
gradlew
gradlew.bat

